creenshot captured","value","2026-10-18","image","gameplay","Mini KSP running locally: first launch after reducing fuel to reach a viable thrust-to-weight ratio.","src","/GameMap/assets/media/learning/deepseek-mini-ksp.webp","alt","A staged rocket lifts from a curved planet with Chinese flight telemetry and a first-launch achievement.","https://github.com/BairlyEmei/mini-ksp","width",1280,"height",720,"credit","GameMap local capture","list","attribution","Creator-attributed clients / models (not inferred from related tools)","items",[82],"DeepSeek Harness","links","Related resources",[88,89],"resourceIds","section",{"_59":92,"_27":93},{"_59":90,"_27":91},"Three.js","/resources/threejs/","DeepSeek · Agent Integrations","/resources/deepseek-agent-integrations/","Creator evidence",[97],"evidence",{"_59":98,"_27":70,"_99":100},"See the creator’s DeepSeek Harness attribution","note","AI development attribution appears in the author-controlled repository description. The Chinese README describes the shipped mechanics and local run procedure.","Source contents","complete project","Project source",[105],{"_59":106,"_27":70,"_99":107},"Open the complete spaceflight project","Complete game, missions, tutorial, styles, 3D workbench, local Three.js, hull textures, and local launch script are included.","Access type","download","demo","Play or run",[113],{"_59":114,"_27":115,"_99":116},"Download and run Mini KSP","https://github.com/BairlyEmei/mini-ksp/archive/refs/heads/main.zip","Source download. Extract it and run python3 start.py; a browser opens on localhost:8000. The main game is 2D; a 3D assembly workbench is included.","Game platform","Source download","Guide format","disclosure","tutorial","Build story / tutorial",[124],{"_59":125,"_27":70,"_99":-7},"Read the creator’s project and run guide","Study this workflow","ordered",true,[130,131,132,133],"Download the repository and run python3 start.py, or open index.html.","Follow the built-in tutorial to assemble, launch, and stage a rocket.","Read the Chinese README and compare the orbital rules with js/game.js.","Inspect the optional 3D construction workbench as a separate subsystem.","AI workflow / foundation context","The creator’s repository description credits DeepSeek Harness. The project includes a roadmap and development instructions, but does not publish the original model conversation.","aiUse","guidance","Creation category","AI-assisted (creator attribution)","category","provenance","Track","2D","track","metadata","Engine","Canvas 2D · JavaScript","engine","lead","2d","ai-assisted",[130,131,132,133],{"_59":125,"_27":70,"_19":120},{"_59":114,"_27":115,"_19":109,"_99":116},{"_59":106,"_27":70,"_99":107,"_160":161},{"_59":98,"_27":70,"_99":100},[158,159],"deepseek-agent-integrations","threejs","scope","complete-project","example:deepseek-neon-snake","deepseek-neon-snake","Snake: Neon Arcade Edition","A neon Snake game with levels, changing speed and grid size, keyboard and touch input, and persistent high scores.","/examples/deepseek-neon-snake/",{"_21":163,"_23":164,"_25":165,"_148":147,"_144":150,"_140":151,"_136":220,"_9":221,"_121":222,"_110":223,"_34":224,"_96":225,"_86":226},[169,170,171,172,173,174,175,176,177,178,179,180,181,182,183,184,185,186,187],{"_55":23,"_61":164,"_57":23,"_87":-7},{"_55":149,"_61":165,"_57":25,"_87":-7},{"_55":56,"_59":146,"_61":147,"_57":148,"_87":137},{"_55":56,"_59":142,"_61":143,"_57":144,"_87":145},{"_55":56,"_59":138,"_61":139,"_57":140,"_87":141},{"_55":56,"_59":134,"_61":220,"_57":136,"_87":137},{"_55":77,"_59":126,"_127":128,"_80":215,"_57":9,"_87":-7},{"_55":83,"_59":122,"_80":212,"_57":121,"_87":-7},{"_55":56,"_59":119,"_61":120,"_57":121,"_87":-7},{"_55":56,"_59":117,"_61":211,"_57":110,"_87":-7},{"_55":83,"_59":111,"_80":207,"_57":110,"_87":-7},{"_55":56,"_59":108,"_61":206,"_57":110,"_87":-7},{"_55":83,"_59":103,"_80":202,"_57":34,"_87":-7},{"_55":56,"_59":101,"_61":102,"_57":34,"_87":-7},{"_55":83,"_59":94,"_80":197,"_57":96,"_87":-7},{"_55":83,"_59":84,"_80":195,"_57":86,"_87":-7},{"_55":77,"_57":78,"_59":79,"_80":193},{"_55":63,"_57":64,"_59":188,"_66":189,"_68":190,"_34":191,"_71":72,"_73":74,"_75":192},{"_55":56,"_57":58,"_59":60,"_61":62},"Neon Snake during play after starting and turning with the keyboard.","/GameMap/assets/media/learning/deepseek-neon-snake.webp","A cyan segmented snake turns toward a glowing red food item on a dark grid.","https://twitchcaptain.com/snake/","GameMap browser capture",[194],"DeepSeek model",[196],{"_59":92,"_27":93},[198],{"_59":199,"_27":200,"_99":201},"See the creator’s DeepSeek attribution","https://github.com/TwitchCaptain/snake","The author-controlled repository description says the game was created by DeepSeek. This is an attribution, not a reproducible prompt log.",[203],{"_59":204,"_27":200,"_99":205},"Open the complete Snake project","Complete HTML, CSS, and JavaScript project. Graphics and sound are produced in code; open index.html to play locally.","playable",[208],{"_59":209,"_27":191,"_99":210},"Play Neon Snake","Move with arrows or WASD, pause with Space or Escape, and avoid walls and your tail. Touch controls are implemented in the source.","Browser",[213],{"_59":214,"_27":200,"_99":-7},"Read the author’s project disclosure",[216,217,218,219],"Play a round and observe how eating food advances the level.","Read the repository’s DeepSeek attribution and gameplay instructions.","Inspect the game loop, input queue, food spawning, and collision handling.","Change one level’s parameters and verify start, pause, loss, and restart.","The creator’s repository description explicitly credits DeepSeek for creating the game. The README documents play and scoring, but no prompts or generation transcript are published.",[216,217,218,219],{"_59":214,"_27":200,"_19":120},{"_59":209,"_27":191,"_19":206,"_99":210},{"_59":204,"_27":200,"_99":205,"_160":161},{"_59":199,"_27":200,"_99":201},[158],"resource:deepseek-agent-integrations","resource","Official guid